# Conformance probe pack for `rest` inside a `length` block counted in bytes
# (spec 0.21 rulings 3 and 5), most significant bit first. Public. No kinds.
#
#   block       an 8-bit length in bytes: recs to the end of the block, x in 8
#               bits and y in 8 bits each
#   byte        z, after the block
format     conformance-extents-length
version    0.21.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
length 8
  group  probe.recs rest
    field  probe.x  8  uint
    field  probe.y  8  uint
  end
end
field   probe.z  8  uint
